{
  "id": "the-simpsons---4x02---a-streetcar-named-margeen",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 4x02 - A Streetcar Named Marge.en",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 4x02 - A Streetcar Named Marge.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-08-31T04:14:29.490Z",
  "lineCount": 265,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[Chorus] ## The Simpsons ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 4000,
      "endMs": 7299
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[Bell Ringing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 18081,
      "endMs": 19981
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[Whistle Blowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 24854,
      "endMs": 27914
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 30393,
      "endMs": 32293
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "## [Jazzy Solo ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38034,
      "endMs": 39934
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 60023,
      "endMs": 61923
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 62025,
      "endMs": 63925
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65295,
      "endMs": 67229
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "[Troy McClure] Live from beautiful Laughlin, Nevada... it's the Miss American Girl Pageant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83313,
      "endMs": 88050
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Brought to you by: Smell like Streep For cheap!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88151,
      "endMs": 92646
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I'm your host, Troy McClure. And now, here come the ladies!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92755,
      "endMs": 96851
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "[ Applause ] ## [ Singing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96960,
      "endMs": 99554
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "[ Troy] Like Miss South Dakota.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105401,
      "endMs": 107995
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Miss North Carolina.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108104,
      "endMs": 110368
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Miss Indiana. Miss Alaska.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110473,
      "endMs": 113203
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Kids, I won't be home tonight, so I'm leaving you some low-cal microwavable TV dinners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113309,
      "endMs": 117473
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Uh-- Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117580,
      "endMs": 118604
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I'm auditioning for a play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118715,
      "endMs": 120774
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "It's a musical version Of A Street car Named Desire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120884,
      "endMs": 123819
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Isn't that exciting?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123920,
      "endMs": 125888
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "[ Troy] If you ask me, they're all winners!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127323,
      "endMs": 129791
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "We'll be cutting our first 40 contestants right after this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129893,
      "endMs": 132691
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Let's take a minute to meet our distinguished panel of judges.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134197,
      "endMs": 137132
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Skin-care consultant, Roweena.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137233,
      "endMs": 139997
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Syndicated columnist, William F. George.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140103,
      "endMs": 142799
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Token black panelist, Drederick Tatum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142906,
      "endMs": 145670
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "And Mr. Boswell, the man behind those infamous worst-dressed lists.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145775,
      "endMs": 150178
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Mr. Boswell, can you give us a sneak peek at this year's list?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150280,
      "endMs": 153443
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Memo to Goldie Hawn: cheerleading tryouts were 30 years ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153549,
      "endMs": 156450
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Let's grow up, shall we?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156552,
      "endMs": 158452
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "[ All Laughing ] He's such a bitch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158554,
      "endMs": 162456
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "I haven't been in a play since high school... and I thought it would be a good chance to meet some other adults.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162558,
      "endMs": 168119
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Sounds interesting. You know, I spend all day alone with Maggie... and sometimes it's like I don't even exist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168231,
      "endMs": 174359
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Sounds interesting. [ Groans ] It's time to name our five finalists... starting with... Miss Montana.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174470,
      "endMs": 182275
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "[Applause] A beaut from Butte.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182378,
      "endMs": 184278
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Miss South Carolina. Nothin' could be finer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184380,
      "endMs": 187178
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Miss Delaware. She, uh--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187283,
      "endMs": 190684
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Good for her. ## [ Singing Scales ] Marge, keep it down in there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192488,
      "endMs": 198692
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Homer, my audition is in half-- Hey, look, it's last year's winner, Debra Jo Smallwood!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198795,
      "endMs": 204255
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Tonight, my reign as Miss American Girl comes to an end.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204367,
      "endMs": 208997
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "And I'd like to apologize one last time... for my unfortunate remarks at the United Nations.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209105,
      "endMs": 214633
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "## [ Classical ] Maggie, cut that racket!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214744,
      "endMs": 220815
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "And where exactly Are you going?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222385,
      "endMs": 224580
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I'm auditioning for a play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224687,
      "endMs": 227349
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Well, this is the first I've heard about it. I told you several times.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227457,
      "endMs": 230722
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "It's a musical version Of A Streetcar Na-- Excuse me, Marge! I think that if you told me, I would remember.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230827,
      "endMs": 236263
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "I mean, I'm not an idiot!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236366,
      "endMs": 238334
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Hm. Well, I-I thought I told you. Kids, back me up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238434,
      "endMs": 241665
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "He's right, Mom. Sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241771,
      "endMs": 243170
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Match point-- Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243272,
      "endMs": 245672
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "I'm sorry, honey. It's okay. We're none of us perfect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245775,
      "endMs": 248676
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "####[Piano] ####[Singers Warming Up] ## [ Vocalizing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248778,
      "endMs": 254441
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Well, howdy-do, neighbor. Hi, Ned.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256185,
      "endMs": 258415
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I didn't know you were an actor. Oh, indeedily-doodily.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258521,
      "endMs": 261183
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Uh, I've even been in Streetcar once before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261290,
      "endMs": 263884
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "I played Blanche DuBois.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263993,
      "endMs": 265927
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Just part of the fun Of going to an all-male school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266029,
      "endMs": 269021
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Hello! I am Llewellyn Sinclair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269132,
      "endMs": 273000
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I have directed three plays in my career... and I have had three heart attacks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273102,
      "endMs": 277832
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "That's how much I care.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277940,
      "endMs": 279840
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "I'm planning for a fourth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279942,
      "endMs": 282001
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Maybe I should have taken a nice calligraphy class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282111,
      "endMs": 284443
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Oh, forget about it. That Mr. Takahashi's a lunatic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284547,
      "endMs": 287414
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Quiet! Sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287517,
      "endMs": 288848
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I am not an easy man to work for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288951,
      "endMs": 292011
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "While directing Hats Off to Hanukkah...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292121,
      "endMs": 295113
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "I reduced more than one cast member to tears.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295224,
      "endMs": 298625
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Did I expect too much from fourth graders?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298728,
      "endMs": 302255
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "The review, \"Play Enjoyed By All, '\" speaks for itself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302365,
      "endMs": 306426
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Hm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306536,
      "endMs": 307901
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Those auditioning for the role of Stanley... take off your shirts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308004,
      "endMs": 312300
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Take off your shirts!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312408,
      "endMs": 314467
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "[ Repeating In French ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 314577,
      "endMs": 316477
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Schnell! Schnell! Schnell!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316579,
      "endMs": 319571
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Uh-uh. Nope. Try joining a gym.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319682,
      "endMs": 323778
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Oh, ye gods!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323886,
      "endMs": 327083
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey, man, if you like that, you should see my butt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327190,
      "endMs": 329886
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "You. You're my Stanley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329992,
      "endMs": 332290
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Hot diggity! How 'bout that, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332395,
      "endMs": 334920
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Little ol' Stanley me. [ Chuckles ] [ Weakly] \"Stella. Stella!\" [ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335031,
      "endMs": 340033
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "## [ Singing ] Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340136,
      "endMs": 342366
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "## [ Singing ] Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342472,
      "endMs": 344804
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "## [ Singing ] Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344907,
      "endMs": 347205
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "## [ Singing ] Thank you for nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347310,
      "endMs": 350473
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "You're all terrible!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350580,
      "endMs": 352207
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "What you ladies don't understand is that Blanche... is a delicate flower being trampled by an uncouth lout-- [ Sighs ] Forget it! just strike the sets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352315,
      "endMs": 363192
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Clear the stage. This production is-- Homie, I didn't get the part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363292,
      "endMs": 367693
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "You were right. Outside interests are stupid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367797,
      "endMs": 370493
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370600,
      "endMs": 372534
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "[ Groans ] I'll come home right away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372635,
      "endMs": 375160
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "All right. I'll pick up a bucket Of fried chicken, extra skin... rolls, chocolate cream parfait--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375271,
      "endMs": 383468
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Stop bothering my Blanche!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383579,
      "endMs": 387709
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387817,
      "endMs": 389717
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "I play an aging Southern beauty who's driven to insanity... by her brutish brother-in-law, Stanley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393656,
      "endMs": 399691
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Wow! My mother the actress.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399795,
      "endMs": 401820
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "I feel like Lucie Arnaz Luckinbill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401931,
      "endMs": 404297
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Are there any jive-talking robots in this play?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404400,
      "endMs": 406391
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I don't think so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406502,
      "endMs": 407901
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Bart, don't ask stupid questions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408004,
      "endMs": 409972
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Is there any frontal nudity? No, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410072,
      "endMs": 412472
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "My name is Helen Lovejoy, and I'll be playing Stella.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412575,
      "endMs": 416204
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I am Apu Nahasapeemapetilon. I play Steve.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416312,
      "endMs": 419645
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "My name is \"Ot-to!\" I'm playing \"Pab-lo!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 419749,
      "endMs": 424777
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Lionel Hutz, attorney-at-law.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424887,
      "endMs": 426787
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "I'm filing a class-action suit against the director... on behalf of everyone who was cut from the play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426889,
      "endMs": 431825
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "I also play Mitch. I'm Marge Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431928,
      "endMs": 434226
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I'll be playing Blanche. I made some peanut butter brownies for everyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434330,
      "endMs": 437788
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Well, would anyone else like a bite of banality? I would.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439802,
      "endMs": 444671
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Stanley-- Yeah?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444774,
      "endMs": 446105
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "You're pulsing with animal lust!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446209,
      "endMs": 447836
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "You take Blanche and you fling her roughly to the bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447944,
      "endMs": 450412
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Roger-dodger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450513,
      "endMs": 452743
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Grr.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454083,
      "endMs": 455983
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Aww, isn't that cute!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457320,
      "endMs": 459311
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "And me without a camera.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 459422,
      "endMs": 461686
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Here. My sister runs a day care center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461791,
      "endMs": 464919
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Hmm. I guess a few weeks wouldn't hurt her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465027,
      "endMs": 467518
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Maggie is allergic To strained pears... and she likes a bottle of warm milk before nap time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469065,
      "endMs": 474402
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "A bottle? [ Laughs ] Mrs. Simpson, do you know what a baby's saying when she reaches for a bottle?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474503,
      "endMs": 480437
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "\"Ba-ba?\" She's saying, \"I am a leech.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480543,
      "endMs": 484980
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Our aim here is to develop the bottle within.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485081,
      "endMs": 487709
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "That sounds awfully harsh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487817,
      "endMs": 489785
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Mrs. Simpson, I don't like to toot my own horn... but we're the only day care center in town... that's not currently under investigation by the state.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489885,
      "endMs": 500085
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Oh. Well, be a good girl, Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500196,
      "endMs": 502892
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Maggie. We don't allow these here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508771,
      "endMs": 511934
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "#You're a dame and I'm a fella # # Stanley, stop or I'll tell Stella # Passion, Mrs. Simpson. Anger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516712,
      "endMs": 524947
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "This man disgusts you! #All I want is one embrace # # I'll twist this bottle in your face # Mm. Mm. Mm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525054,
      "endMs": 533387
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Here, Marge, let me. Hate to be an armchair Blanche... but I always gave it one of these--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533496,
      "endMs": 538826
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "There. There's the ol' face-shredder. Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540169,
      "endMs": 542262
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Mrs. Simpson, if you set out to push the bile to the tip of my throat... mission accomplished!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542371,
      "endMs": 548706
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "I'm, uh-- I'm gonna crawl into bed with a bottle of amaretto.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548811,
      "endMs": 551746
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Good day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551847,
      "endMs": 553838
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "[ Homer] Easy, easy. Yes, yes. Yes, yes, yes-- D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553949,
      "endMs": 556679
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "[ Electronic Voice ] 7-1 0 split.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556786,
      "endMs": 558686
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Homer, can you run some lines with me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 558788,
      "endMs": 561052
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Make Bart do it. It'll just take a sec.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561157,
      "endMs": 563625
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Gutter ball! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563726,
      "endMs": 565284
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "You see, Marge, while you're Off in your own little world... you forgot that other people have problems too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 565394,
      "endMs": 570488
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 584513,
      "endMs": 586413
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "####[Action Movie Theme]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589985,
      "endMs": 592453
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "[ Objects Crashing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 615578,
      "endMs": 617478
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Don't like to nap, eh? We have a place for babies like you-- the box!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625121,
      "endMs": 629558
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "All right, let \"ham-ateur\" night in Dixie commence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639802,
      "endMs": 643670
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Llewellyn, I just-- I just don't see why Blanche should shove a broken bottle in Stanley's face.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646242,
      "endMs": 653108
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Couldn't she just take his abuse with gentle good humor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653215,
      "endMs": 656946
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Marge, your ride's here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657052,
      "endMs": 659077
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Homer, it'll just be a few minutes more!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659188,
      "endMs": 661748
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "#You're a dame and I'm a fella # # Stanley, stop or I'll tell Stella # Marge. Marge! I'm asking For white-hot rage... and you're giving me a hissy fit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661857,
      "endMs": 673531
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Marge, can I get some change for the candy machine?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673636,
      "endMs": 676196
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Oh, here! [ Clattering ] Hey, there's some quarters in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676305,
      "endMs": 681909
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I just don't see what's so bad about Stanley.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682011,
      "endMs": 684605
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 684713,
      "endMs": 686613
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Stanley is thoughtless, violent and loud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686715,
      "endMs": 689912
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Marge, every second you spend with this man... he is crushing your fragile spirit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690019,
      "endMs": 694952
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "You can't let that happen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695057,
      "endMs": 696957
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "[Yelling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 697059,
      "endMs": 699220
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! Come to papa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700329,
      "endMs": 702229
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Marge, I'll be out in the car.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702331,
      "endMs": 704231
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "#All I want is one embrace #",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704333,
      "endMs": 707097
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "[Car Horn Honking] Marge, move it or lose it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707203,
      "endMs": 710263
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "# I'll twist this bottle in your face # Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714677,
      "endMs": 719781
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Hallelujah! I've done it again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719882,
      "endMs": 722646
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Ned, you're supposed to overpower her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722751,
      "endMs": 724810
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "I'm trying. I'm trying. [ Straining ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724920,
      "endMs": 727218
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Salt me. [ Southern Accent ] Here you are, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733662,
      "endMs": 737063
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "What the-- Why are you talking like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737166,
      "endMs": 739396
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "The play's tomorrow night. [ With Accent ] I've got to stay in character.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739502,
      "endMs": 742960
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "[ With Accent ] Would it help if I talked like this too? - It might.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743072,
      "endMs": 746098
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "[ Cockney Accent ] An' I'll talk like 'is. Bob's yer uncle, mate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746208,
      "endMs": 748836
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "That really doesn't help, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748944,
      "endMs": 750411
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Big Daddy, would y'all mind passin' a lil' ol' biscuit?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750513,
      "endMs": 752879
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Can I slog off school tomorrow? Got a pain in me gulliver.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752982,
      "endMs": 755576
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I'm livin' in a cuckoo clock!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755684,
      "endMs": 757345
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Oh, see you later, kids. I've got to go rehearse with Ned.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757453,
      "endMs": 761014
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "But, Marge, what about dessert?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761123,
      "endMs": 763023
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "For God's sakes, you can pull the lid off your own can of pudding!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763125,
      "endMs": 765753
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Fine. I will!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765861,
      "endMs": 767419
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "[ Screeches ] Oh, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770165,
      "endMs": 772065
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "My pudding is trapped forever!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772167,
      "endMs": 774067
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "So I can open my own can Of pudding, can I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774169,
      "endMs": 776535
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Shows what you know, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 776639,
      "endMs": 778766
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778874,
      "endMs": 781172
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Hey, Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782278,
      "endMs": 784542
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Keep yelling, you big ape.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784647,
      "endMs": 786615
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Aren't you being a little hard on old Homie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786715,
      "endMs": 788979
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Oh, forget about him. Let's rehearse the bottle scene.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789084,
      "endMs": 792611
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Oh! Let's not and say we did. Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793656,
      "endMs": 796056
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "[ Muttering Lines ] So, what time does this play start?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796158,
      "endMs": 800322
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Why? Are you going? Well, I gotta go, don't I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800429,
      "endMs": 803262
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "I'm sure you won't enjoy it. There's nothing about bowling in the play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803365,
      "endMs": 807392
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Oh, wait, there is. Probably not much of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807503,
      "endMs": 810472
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Why can't you be a little more supportive?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810573,
      "endMs": 812473
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "'Cause I don't care, okay? I can't fake an interest in this... and I'm an expert at faking an interest in your kooky projects.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812575,
      "endMs": 819409
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "What \"kooky projects\"? You know, the painting class... the first aid course, the whole Lamaze thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 819515,
      "endMs": 824245
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Why didn't you tell me you felt this way?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824353,
      "endMs": 826150
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "You know I would never do anything to hurt your feelings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826255,
      "endMs": 829315
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Good night. [ Snores ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829425,
      "endMs": 831450
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "[ Groans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 832995,
      "endMs": 835930
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Playing nicely, little humans? Good, good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836031,
      "endMs": 839364
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Hello, Maggie. Poor little \"dummard.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839468,
      "endMs": 842130
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "####[Action Movie Theme]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846742,
      "endMs": 848767
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Hey, kids! I'm flame-retardant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870532,
      "endMs": 872830
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "[ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 872935,
      "endMs": 875096
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "[Footsteps Approaching]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 878140,
      "endMs": 881371
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "[ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 889985,
      "endMs": 892112
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "If I break, buy a new one. [Laughs]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893255,
      "endMs": 897214
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "[Shatters] [ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900029,
      "endMs": 901826
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "[ Squealing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 918180,
      "endMs": 920080
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Maggie, time to go to the-- [Screeches]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925921,
      "endMs": 928583
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "[ Loud Sucking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 928691,
      "endMs": 930659
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "[ Shudders ] Babies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957886,
      "endMs": 960150
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Perhaps we are all A little mad... we who don the cap and bells and tread beneath the proscenium arch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 964193,
      "endMs": 969961
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "But tonight, you will all be transformed from dead-eyed suburbanites... into white-hot grease fires of pure entertainment!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970065,
      "endMs": 978237
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Except you. You're not working out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978340,
      "endMs": 980240
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "I'll be playing your part. Drag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980342,
      "endMs": 982242
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "[Murmuring] ####[Piano: Intro] # Long before the Superdome # #Where the Saints of football play# # Lived a city that the damned call home # # Hear their hellish # # Rondelet #",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982344,
      "endMs": 1002724
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "[ Creaking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1002831,
      "endMs": 1005163
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "####[Orchestra] # New Orleans # # Home of pirates drunks and whores # # New Orleans # # Tacky, overpriced souvenir stores # # If you wanna go to hell you should take that trip # #To the Sodom and Gomorrah on the \"Mississip\" # # New Orleans # # Stinking, rotten \"vomity\" vile # # New Orleans # # Putrid, brackish maggoty, foul # # New Orleans## # Crummy, lousy rancid and rank# # New Orleans # [Woman] What's the matter, honey? Are you lost?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006869,
      "endMs": 1039996
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "[Marge] I'm lookin' for my sister, Stella.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040102,
      "endMs": 1042468
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "[Lisa] It's Mom! Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042571,
      "endMs": 1044471
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "My name is Blanche DuBois.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044573,
      "endMs": 1046564
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "####[Jazz]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046675,
      "endMs": 1048870
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "# I thought my life would be a Mardi Gras # #A never-ending party# Ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052748,
      "endMs": 1062183
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "# I'm a faded Southern dame # #Without a dime ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062291,
      "endMs": 1069788
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "I'm collecting for the Evening Star.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071733,
      "endMs": 1074258
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Come here. I want to kiss you... just once, softly and sweetly on your mouth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074369,
      "endMs": 1082468
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "####[Orchestra] # I am just a simple paperboy# # No romance do I seek# # I just wanted 40 cents # # For my deliveries last week# #Will this bewitching floozy# # Seduce this humble newsie # # Oh, what's a paperboy to #",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082578,
      "endMs": 1116406
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "# Do # ####[Ends]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1118347,
      "endMs": 1123580
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126755,
      "endMs": 1129280
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "####[Orchestra] Stella!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129391,
      "endMs": 1132622
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Stella!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132728,
      "endMs": 1136027
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "# Can't you hear me yell-a # #You're puttin' me through hell-a # # Stella ## Stella!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136131,
      "endMs": 1146934
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Oh! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147042,
      "endMs": 1150375
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Cool. She can fly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153615,
      "endMs": 1155515
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "I think it's supposed to symbolize her descent into madness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155617,
      "endMs": 1158711
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Oh! Oh! Oh! ####[Fades]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158820,
      "endMs": 1161846
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Whoever you are, I have always depended... on the kindness of strangers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165928,
      "endMs": 1172530
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "####[Orchestra] - #You can always depend on the kindness of strangers # #To buck up your spirits and shield you from dangers # # Now here's a tip from Blanche you won't regret # #A stranger's just a friend you haven't met # #You haven't met ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172634,
      "endMs": 1193787
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Streetcar! ####[Ends] Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1193889,
      "endMs": 1199051
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Ah! [ Chuckles ] [ Together] Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201330,
      "endMs": 1205466
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "You people out there, you're the stars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1221316,
      "endMs": 1224877
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Cool!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1224987,
      "endMs": 1226750
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Hey, look at me. I'm Blanche DuBois.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1231727,
      "endMs": 1234093
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Mom! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1234196,
      "endMs": 1236096
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Way to go, Mom! Everybody was cheering for you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1236198,
      "endMs": 1240498
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Almost everybody. Kids, wait in the car.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1240602,
      "endMs": 1243435
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "I want to talk to your mother about this play thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1243538,
      "endMs": 1246132
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "[ With Accent ] Lookin' for a spot off un with the missus, hey, guv'nor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1246241,
      "endMs": 1249472
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Shut up, boy. Marge, you were terrific.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1249578,
      "endMs": 1252308
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Oh, come on, Homer. By the end, you were so bored... you could barely keep your selfish head up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1252414,
      "endMs": 1258141
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "I wasn't bored. I was sad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1258253,
      "endMs": 1260153
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "It really got to me how that lady, uh, um--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260255,
      "endMs": 1264487
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "You know which one I mean. You played her. Blanche.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1264593,
      "endMs": 1267653
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Yeah. How Blanche was sad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267763,
      "endMs": 1270163
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "And how that guy Stanley should have been nice to her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1270265,
      "endMs": 1273098
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Yeah? Go on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1273201,
      "endMs": 1274862
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "I mean, it made me feel bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1274970,
      "endMs": 1276870
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "The poor thing ends up being hauled to the nuthouse... when all she needed was for that big slob to show her some respect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1276972,
      "endMs": 1283974
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Well, at least that's what I thought.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1284079,
      "endMs": 1285979
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "I have a history of missing the point of stuff like this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1286081,
      "endMs": 1288845
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "No, Homer, you got it just right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1288950,
      "endMs": 1291316
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Hey, you know, I'm a lot like that guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1293121,
      "endMs": 1295487
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Really? - Yeah, like when I pick my teeth with the mail and stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1295590,
      "endMs": 1299424
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Well, maybe just a little.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1299528,
      "endMs": 1302053
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "[ People Chattering ] Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1372501,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ]
}
